rgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-25T04:13:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T17:20:28Z","closed_at":"2026-08-12T17:20:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.7 dev5 and later\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9636) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K (32 threads) - 127.7 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nStarting with 4.7 dev5, Vertex colors will never be applied as the albedo color upon import, no matter which flags are set in the GLTF 2.0 exporter.\n\nIt will always result in the base material color, unless you try and force it by adding the -vcol suffix to the material name. Unfortunately, that _also_ sets the \"Is sRGB\" flag, which then makes any vertex colors on GLTF models much darker than intended.\n\nCurrently, you must extract the materials for each model and set 'Use as Albedo' manually. This creates a large amount of overhead for what used to be automatically handled\n\nHere is the issue in 4.7 dev5 and later (dark -vcol model on the right):\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1044\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7765db9-d0ec-45aa-9e15-3bf2d290f0f0\" />\n\nHere's the expected behavior from prior versions (dark -vcol model on the right):\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1044\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56391604-2e9d-413d-98f0-f6d42e689dac\" />\n\nThe above models were exported with Blender 5.1.2\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Import gltf/glb model with vertex colors\n2. Place into scene\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[vertex-colors-4.7-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29324872/vertex-colors-4.7-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120625/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120625/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}